              "type": "italic"
            }
          ],
          "text": "learn python"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". Recognizing common pitfalls early on can save you time and frustration. Let's explore a couple of frequent hurdles and how to overcome them, strengthening your grasp of "
